{"text": "In a little part of New York. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Called Greenwich Village. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The streets run crazily. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And cross each other. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In strange ways. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Artists soon came to live there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Because the rooms were old and cheap. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At the top of a short brick building. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Sue and Johnsy had their studio. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They had met in May at a cheap restaurant. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And found. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That their tastes in art were the same. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So they decided. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To share a studio. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In November. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A cold, unseen stranger. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Whom the doctors called Pneumonia. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Walked through the Village. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He touched one person here. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And another there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With his icy fingers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One of the people. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He touched. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Was Johnsy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She lay in her bed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Hardly moving. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And looked through the window. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At the brick wall of the next house.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "n", " ", "a", " ", "l", "i", "t", "t", "l", "e", " ", "p", "a", "r", "t", " ", "o", "f", " ", "N", "e", "w", " ", "Y", "o", "r", "k", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "C", "a", "l", "l", "e", "d", " ", "G", "r", "e", "e", "n", "w", "i", "c", "h", " ", "V", "i", "l", "l", "a", "g", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "s", "t", "r", "e", "e", "t", "s", " ", "r", "u", "n", " ", "c", "r", "a", "z",